BAZADA YO‘Q BO‘LSA — BEPUL MANBALARDAN OLISH (Fallback zanjiri):
3A (2D SVG uchun): Bepul va kalitsiz Iconify API (https://api.iconify.design/search?query={name_en}&limit=3) orqali mos ikonka/vektorni qidir va https://api.iconify.design/{prefix}/{name}.svg orqali toza <svg> kodini yuklab ol.
3B (3D uchun, agar 3D rejim yoqilgan bo‘lsa): Ochiq bazadan (masalan, Poly Pizza API) tayyor .glb model havolasini qidir.
